      <div type="clause" n="Prol.">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:VIIIAtr">VIII Atr</ref> Prol.</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Þis is an ðara gerædnessa þe Engla cyningc gedihte mid his witena geþeahte.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">This is one of the ordinances which the English king drew up with the advice of his councillors.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Ðis is an ðæra gerædnessa, þe Engla cyng gedihte mid hid witena geðehte.</ab>
